        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Navakoti Narayana\n- People: S. K. Ananthachari, Rajkumar, Sowcar Janaki, Purandara Dasa, B. V. Radha\n- Concepts: Carnatic music, Haridasa\n\nFacts:\n- Purandara Dasa lived from 1484 to 1564.\n- Purandara Dasa was a Haridasa, a devotee of Lord Hari (Vishnu), a devotee of Lord Krishna, and a saint.\n- Navakoti Narayana is a 1964 Indian Kannada film.\n- Navakoti Narayana was directed by S. K. Ananthachari.\n- Navakoti Narayana stars Rajkumar and Sowcar Janaki in the lead roles.\n- Navakoti Narayana is based on the life of Purandara Dasa, a prominent composer of Carnatic music.\n- B. V. Radha started her career in the 1964 Kannada film Navakoti Narayana.",
